# Ponytail

Before writing or editing code, read `.cursor/skills/ponytail/SKILL.md` and climb the ladder: YAGNI → reuse this repo → stdlib → native → installed dep → one line → minimum that works.

Do not skip for “small” diffs. Intensity `full` unless the user says `/ponytail ultra` or `stop ponytail`.

Never cut: trust-boundary validation, data-loss error handling, security, accessibility, hardware calibration, anything the user explicitly asked for.

Bug fix = shared root cause, not one caller. Review skills: `ponytail-review`, `ponytail-audit`.
